      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A Persian Gulf War veteran presented to the University Neuro-Urology service for management of severe chronic perineal pain. The overall physical and neurological exam was unremarkable. However, the rectal exam and the urodynamic study revealed a severe pelvic floor dysfunction. A neuro-behavioral approach is recommended and discussed."},
